    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34282" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπελ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring near</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίφρους
				ἐμπελάσαντες</span>
			<i>having brought up</i> the chariots, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				109
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>come near, approach</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοίτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, <i>approach</i>, c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπελάσειν πυκινῷ δόμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					523
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴδωλα ἐ. τοῖς ἀνθρώποις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					166
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποῦ δ᾽ ἐμπελάζεις
			τἀνδρί</span> . . ; <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				748
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆ ἀκοῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					395a19
				</span></i>
			: abs., ib.<i><span class="en">
				b28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρήνης μηδὲ σχεδὸν ἐμπελάσειας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					32a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in 
				Pass.
			, wrongly used for 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπαλάσσομαι, τοῖσι αὐτοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλήλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					36.49
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				62.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὑτοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					72.19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
